- [Dedicated Server Hardware – Overview](https://docs.hetzner.com/robot/dedicated-server/dedicated-server-hardware/dedicated-server-hardware-overview/): Order extra server hardware via Robot support. Installation takes 30-60 minutes. Check Server Auction FAQs for discounted models.
- [Minimum hardware configuration](https://docs.hetzner.com/robot/dedicated-server/dedicated-server-hardware/minimum-hardware-configuration/): Minimal configuration of the former DS server models.
