- [Upgrading Dedicated servers: options, procedure and requirements](https://docs.hetzner.com/robot/dedicated-server/dedicated-server-hardware/dedicated-server-upgrade/): Instructions for requesting dedicated server upgrades via verified Robot support and required information.
- [Dell PowerEdge Quickstart Guide](https://docs.hetzner.com/robot/dedicated-server/dell-quickstart/dell-poweredge-quickstart-guide/): Intro: Dell servers shipped without OS; use Rescue System, configure RAID, then install OS or mount ISO via KVM.
- [Dell PowerEdge Quickstart Guide 12G-13G](https://docs.hetzner.com/robot/dedicated-server/dell-quickstart/dell-poweredge-quickstart-guide-12g-13g/): Use iDRAC IP from activation email to access web interface and manage KVM, power, ISO, and hardware diagnostics.
- [Dell PowerEdge Quickstart Guide 14G](https://docs.hetzner.com/robot/dedicated-server/dell-quickstart/dell-poweredge-quickstart-guide-14g/): Overview of Dell PowerEdge 14th generation server usage and guidance.
- [Dell PowerEdge Quickstart Guide 17G](https://docs.hetzner.com/robot/dedicated-server/dell-quickstart/dell-poweredge-quickstart-guide-17g/): Access iDRAC via browser using order email credentials to manage server power, KVM, and diagnostics.
- [Error FAQ](https://docs.hetzner.com/robot/dedicated-server/faq/error-faq/): Troubleshooting Robot login and order issues: enable browser cookies and ensure a valid Robot account email address.
- [FAQ](https://docs.hetzner.com/robot/dedicated-server/faq/faq/): Install standard images with custom partitioning and RAID using installimage in Rescue System.
- [Custom Solutions](https://docs.hetzner.com/robot/dedicated-server/general-information/custom-solutions/): Custom IT solutions featuring private interconnections, managed switches, server clusters, and tailored LAN/WAN networks for special needs.
