- [Contact information verification](https://docs.hetzner.com/robot/domain-registration-robot/contact-information-verification/): Erklärt die obligatorische E-Mail-Verifizierung für .com/.net- und .de-Domains; 14-tägige Frist vor der Sperrung der Domain.
- [Domain Robot Error FAQ](https://docs.hetzner.com/robot/domain-registration-robot/error-faq/): Handles are tied to specific TLDs; e.g., .de handles only work for .de domains.
- [Domain Robot FAQ](https://docs.hetzner.com/robot/domain-registration-robot/faq/): Administer .de/.com/.net/.org/.eu domains via Robot; create DNS entries and manage Robot-specific handles and email API.
- [E-Mail-Interface (30 Sept 2019 Changes)](https://docs.hetzner.com/robot/domain-registration-robot/email-interface-30-sept-2019/): Guide to creating new person or organization handles via Hetzner Robot email API with required contact details.
- [Email Interface](https://docs.hetzner.com/robot/domain-registration-robot/email-interface/): Guide to the Hetzner Registration Robot for managing WHOIS handles, nameservers, and domain registrations via PGP-signed emails.
- [ERRP](https://docs.hetzner.com/robot/domain-registration-robot/errp/): Explains automatic domain renewal, expiration notifications, cancellation, and domain restoration processes.
- [Getting started](https://docs.hetzner.com/robot/domain-registration-robot/getting-started/): Tutorial overview for registering a domain using Hetzner Domain Registration Robot and required steps.
- [Tutorial ChProv](https://docs.hetzner.com/robot/domain-registration-robot/tutorial-chprov/): Overview of transferring a domain to Hetzner using the Domain Registration Robot (ChProv) process.
- [Tutorial ChProv outgoing](https://docs.hetzner.com/robot/domain-registration-robot/tutorial-chprov-outgoing/): Guide to transferring a Hetzner domain to another provider using the Robot interface and Auth-Code.
- [DNS delegating](https://docs.hetzner.com/robot/domain-registration-robot/dns/dns-delegating/): Explains DNS delegation: who can delegate, procedure via registries/Hetzner Robot, and parent zone file entries.

## Managed

### General

- [Welcome to Managed Products from Hetzner](https://docs.hetzner.com/managed/general/welcome/): konsoleH: secure SSL interface to manage your hostings, domains, webmail, orders, upgrades, and settings.
- [Software updates](https://docs.hetzner.com/managed/general/softwareupdates/): PostgreSQL upgraded to 17, MariaDB to 11.8; Webserver PHP integration via FPM; HTTP/3 support; Support for post-quantum cryptography

### Administration on konsoleH

- [Overview konsoleH](https://docs.hetzner.com/managed/administration-on-konsoleh/introduction-konsoleh/): Manage hosting settings and content: domains, email, redirects, files, databases, and view logs.
- [Account maintenance](https://docs.hetzner.com/managed/administration-on-konsoleh/account-maintenance/): Explains hierarchical maintenance rules: domain, server, general, and default precedence on konsoleH.
- [Account migration FAQ](https://docs.hetzner.com/managed/administration-on-konsoleh/account-migration/): Confirmation that existing konsoleH customer data was migrated to Hetzner Accounts.
- [Backup for managed products](https://docs.hetzner.com/managed/administration-on-konsoleh/backup/): Explains selecting public_html backup, restore options (all or individual), overwrite, create new directory, delete-before-restore, and process notes.
- [Block and unblock a hosting or a domain](https://docs.hetzner.com/managed/administration-on-konsoleh/block/): Guide to locking/unlocking hosting or domain, including abuse Lock levels and self-unlock limitations.
- [Change your provider to Hetzner](https://docs.hetzner.com/managed/administration-on-konsoleh/change-of-provider/): Step-by-step guide to transferring your domain to Hetzner, including setup, DNS TTL, auth-code, and transfer timelines.
- [Cron Job Manager](https://docs.hetzner.com/managed/administration-on-konsoleh/cronmanager/): Manage cron jobs: view status, activate/deactivate, edit, delete, execute, and check script output.
- [Installation of additional software](https://docs.hetzner.com/managed/administration-on-konsoleh/installation-of-additional-software/): Install and manage software packages on managed servers via the 'software' CLI (install, upgrade, uninstall, list).
- [Managed Server Firewall](https://docs.hetzner.com/managed/administration-on-konsoleh/managed-firewall/): Managing the Managed Server Firewall: Port forwarding, IP blocking, whitelisting, and security recommendations for various server deployments.
- [Node.js Configuration](https://docs.hetzner.com/managed/administration-on-konsoleh/nodejs/): Guide to activating Node.js in konsoleH or Managed Servers, noting deactivation of other web apps and SSH alternative.
- [Open Ports](https://docs.hetzner.com/managed/administration-on-konsoleh/openports/): Configure and manage IPv4/IPv6 firewall port rules via konsoleH, including parameters, limits, and management options.
- [Product overview and customer account](https://docs.hetzner.com/managed/administration-on-konsoleh/account-overview/): Guide to konsoleH navigation: product overview, Info Centre, management, orders, language switch, opening items.
- [Redis Configuration](https://docs.hetzner.com/managed/administration-on-konsoleh/redis/): Guide to enabling and configuring Redis on managed servers and from Webhosting L via konsoleH, including socket usage and limits.
- [Varnish Configuration](https://docs.hetzner.com/managed/administration-on-konsoleh/varnish/): Guide to enabling and configuring Varnish on konsoleH: templates, TTL, static files, URL/cookie/header caching rules.
- [FTP & SFTP](https://docs.hetzner.com/managed/administration-on-konsoleh/access-details/ftp-sftp/): Main FTP user access details, password change, FTPS and SFTP encryption and ports.
- [konsoleH WebFTP](https://docs.hetzner.com/managed/administration-on-konsoleh/access-details/web-ftp/): WebFTP interface: search, upload, edit, download files, change directories, view permissions/owners, and access FTP logs.
- [Security of your data on managed products](https://docs.hetzner.com/managed/administration-on-konsoleh/access-details/secure-connections/): Overview of Hetzner’s encrypted access methods: HTTPS admin/webmail, TLS mail, FTPS/SFTP, SSH (port 222), optional SSL certificates.
- [SSH Access for Managed Products](https://docs.hetzner.com/managed/administration-on-konsoleh/access-details/ssh/): SSH access limited to Managed Servers or eligible hosting; no root access; check konsoleH or contact Support.

