- [Backup, restore & migration](https://docs.hetzner.com/managed/databases/general/backup-migration/): Steps to migrate website and database from another host to konsoleH, including export, import, and DNS testing.

### Domain and DNS

- [Auth code on konsoleH](https://docs.hetzner.com/managed/domain-and-dns/auth-code-konsoleh/): Log in to konsoleH, cancel account to receive auth code; validity: .de 30 days, .eu 40 days.
- [Contact details verification konsoleH](https://docs.hetzner.com/managed/domain-and-dns/verification-of-contact-details/): ICANN-required email verification for new international domain contacts; unverified domains blocked after 14 days, resendable upon request.
- [DNS Administration konsoleH](https://docs.hetzner.com/managed/domain-and-dns/dnsadministration/): Overview of DNS management in Hetzner konsoleH and link to full DNS documentation.
