- [konsoleH Domain FAQ](https://docs.hetzner.com/managed/domain-and-dns/konsoleh-domain-faq/): The customer or specified entity is registered as the legal domain owner and administrator.
- [Ordering Domains](https://docs.hetzner.com/managed/domain-and-dns/order-domain/): Step-by-step guide to ordering and configuring addon domains on Hetzner webspace, including registration, transfer, and DNS notes.
- [Redirect a domain to subdomain www by default](https://docs.hetzner.com/managed/domain-and-dns/redirection-of-a-domain/): .htaccess mod_rewrite examples to redirect non-www and addon domains to a preferred www domain using 301 rules.
- [Subdomain administration](https://docs.hetzner.com/managed/domain-and-dns/subdomain/): Manage, create, edit and delete subdomains, set target directories under /public_html/, and note 24-hour propagation.

### Email

- [Email security with DKIM, SPF, and DMARC](https://docs.hetzner.com/managed/email/email-security/): Explains DKIM: digital signatures for emails, key pair usage, DNS public key, and enabling or using own keys.
- [Mail logs & Mail system](https://docs.hetzner.com/managed/email/maillogs-mailsystem/): Overview of mail logs showing sender, recipient, server, IP, errors, and unique Message-ID per email.
- [Catch-all Address Setup](https://docs.hetzner.com/managed/email/email-address/catch-all-address/): Explanation: Mailbox that receives all emails sent to non-existent addresses for a domain.
- [Set up email forwarding](https://docs.hetzner.com/managed/email/email-address/email-forwarding/): Virtual email alias that forwards incoming messages to one or more mailboxes.
- [Set up SMTP relay](https://docs.hetzner.com/managed/email/email-address/smtp-relay/): Configure an SMTP relay via a subdomain to send emails from a managed server alongside Microsoft 365.
- [Autoresponder](https://docs.hetzner.com/managed/email/mailbox-features/autoresponder/): Guide to viewing and configuring Webmail autoresponder: status, subject, message, interval, and auto-disable date.
- [Mail storage space and Quotas](https://docs.hetzner.com/managed/email/mailbox-features/email-storage-and-quotas/): Guide to reducing email storage: forwarders, POP3 access, account maintenance and mailbox limits.
- [Mailimport](https://docs.hetzner.com/managed/email/mailbox-features/mailimport/): Required IMAP and mailbox credentials, password rules, and single or CSV methods to add mailboxes to mailimport.
- [Manage mailboxes](https://docs.hetzner.com/managed/email/mailbox-features/mailbox-management/): Step-by-step guide to create a new mailbox and set username/password in konsoleH.
- [Spam filters and email filters](https://docs.hetzner.com/managed/email/mailbox-features/spamfilters-and-mailfilters/): Overview of konsoleH's global spam filter moving identified spam to the spambucket folder.
- [Email account Configuration](https://docs.hetzner.com/managed/email/set-up-email-account/setting-up-an-email-account/): Step-by-step email client setup with IMAP/POP3 and SMTP server, ports, and credentials.
- [Set up an e-mail account in macOS](https://docs.hetzner.com/managed/email/set-up-email-account/setting-up-an-email-account-in-macos/): Step-by-step guide to install a konsoleH .mobileconfig mailbox on macOS and add it to Mail app.
- [Set up e-mail account in iOS and iPadOS](https://docs.hetzner.com/managed/email/set-up-email-account/setting-up-an-email-account-in-ios-and-ipados/): Step-by-step guide to download and install a konsoleH .mobileconfig for Mail on iPhone and iPad.
- [Setting up an ActiveSync account in Outlook](https://docs.hetzner.com/managed/email/set-up-email-account/setting-up-an-activesync-account-in-outlook/): Current Outlook versions not recommended with ActiveSync; use IMAP/SMTP for mail and CalDAV Synchronizer for contacts/calendars.
- [Synchronise calendar with webmail](https://docs.hetzner.com/managed/email/webmail/synchronise-your-calendar-and-contacts/): How to find and use CalDAV/CardDAV subscription addresses and login credentials for syncing calendars and address books.
- [Using Webmail](https://docs.hetzner.com/managed/email/webmail/how-to-use-webmail/): Overview of webmail features: address book, filters, calendar, tasks, notes, account settings, and more.

